      "text": "READ | The Philippine Consulate General in Hong Kong reported that, as of 8 p.m. today, a total of 63 Filipinos affected by the Tai Po fire incident have been confirmed safe. \n\nOne Filipino sustained injuries and is currently receiving medical assistance, while another individual remains missing and cannot be contacted.\n\nThe consulate also noted that 28 more individuals are still undergoing verification. These individuals are believed to be residents of the affected area, but their whereabouts have not yet been confirmed. | via Katrina Manubay\n\n📷: Philippine Consulate in Hong Kong\n\nFor more info, visit https://t.co/rmQCnNSOvI.",
